    "detailed_description": "<h1>Road Map</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2494810/extras/d279fd1a62099db26b7386705a61e916.avif?t=1752468401\" /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dark Hunting Ground</h2>A minimalist pixel-action RPG built around loot and power.<br><br>As a new member of the Hunter\u2019s Association, you\u2019ll hunt monsters and face the creeping threat of the Void. Grow stronger with every battle\u2014gathering loot, leveling up, and forging your build\u2014until you're ready to confront the source of the corruption itself.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Straight to the Point</h2>No bloated story. No filler. Just clean, streamlined combat and build-focused progression.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2494810/extras/8ed1c9d97bfcaf51ab70acc1a8faef95.poster.avif?t=1752468401\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2494810/extras/8ed1c9d97bfcaf51ab70acc1a8faef95.webm?t=1752468401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2494810/extras/8ed1c9d97bfcaf51ab70acc1a8faef95.mp4?t=1752468401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deep Builds, Minimalist Design</h2>Master complex, multi-layered builds where synergy is everything. Smart combinations and dimensional layering are key to becoming a true hunter.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2494810/extras/71620589d48fd08c18ca0d7536b17bfb.poster.avif?t=1752468401\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2494810/extras/71620589d48fd08c18ca0d7536b17bfb.webm?t=1752468401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2494810/extras/71620589d48fd08c18ca0d7536b17bfb.mp4?t=1752468401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Loot, Optimized</h2>Go from hands-on farming to fully automated looting as you refine your systems. The grind evolves\u2014your power does too.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2494810/extras/e911b40e4b50b72e7e22e411600dd7c8.poster.avif?t=1752468401\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2494810/extras/e911b40e4b50b72e7e22e411600dd7c8.webm?t=1752468401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2494810/extras/e911b40e4b50b72e7e22e411600dd7c8.mp4?t=1752468401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Descend into the Void</h2>The further you go, the harder it gets. Face ever-stronger Void Lords, test the limits of your build, and push into the endless depths.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2494810/extras/db5f23df3c865ac1cf92e7eebe8d2970.poster.avif?t=1752468401\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2494810/extras/db5f23df3c865ac1cf92e7eebe8d2970.webm?t=1752468401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2494810/extras/db5f23df3c865ac1cf92e7eebe8d2970.mp4?t=1752468401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dark Hunting Ground</h2>A minimalist pixel-action RPG built around loot and power.<br><br>As a new member of the Hunter\u2019s Association, you\u2019ll hunt monsters and face the creeping threat of the Void. Grow stronger with every battle\u2014gathering loot, leveling up, and forging your build\u2014until you're ready to confront the source of the corruption itself.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Straight to the Point</h2>No bloated story. No filler. Just clean, streamlined combat and build-focused progression.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2494810/extras/8ed1c9d97bfcaf51ab70acc1a8faef95.poster.avif?t=1752468401\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2494810/extras/8ed1c9d97bfcaf51ab70acc1a8faef95.webm?t=1752468401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2494810/extras/8ed1c9d97bfcaf51ab70acc1a8faef95.mp4?t=1752468401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deep Builds, Minimalist Design</h2>Master complex, multi-layered builds where synergy is everything. Smart combinations and dimensional layering are key to becoming a true hunter.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2494810/extras/71620589d48fd08c18ca0d7536b17bfb.poster.avif?t=1752468401\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2494810/extras/71620589d48fd08c18ca0d7536b17bfb.webm?t=1752468401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2494810/extras/71620589d48fd08c18ca0d7536b17bfb.mp4?t=1752468401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Loot, Optimized</h2>Go from hands-on farming to fully automated looting as you refine your systems. The grind evolves\u2014your power does too.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2494810/extras/e911b40e4b50b72e7e22e411600dd7c8.poster.avif?t=1752468401\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2494810/extras/e911b40e4b50b72e7e22e411600dd7c8.webm?t=1752468401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2494810/extras/e911b40e4b50b72e7e22e411600dd7c8.mp4?t=1752468401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Descend into the Void</h2>The further you go, the harder it gets. Face ever-stronger Void Lords, test the limits of your build, and push into the endless depths.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2494810/extras/db5f23df3c865ac1cf92e7eebe8d2970.poster.avif?t=1752468401\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2494810/extras/db5f23df3c865ac1cf92e7eebe8d2970.webm?t=1752468401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2494810/extras/db5f23df3c865ac1cf92e7eebe8d2970.mp4?t=1752468401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
